<http://data.silknow.org/object/23f2bf68-831f-3860-983f-d9d538409eb2>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "This bonnet is a style known as a 'capote' bonnet. It was worn at a forward angle on the crown of the head with the wearer's hair piled up high underneath. The bonnet was held on by the ribbons which tied in a large bow beneath the chin.\n\nThis period in the later 19th century saw a craze for all  forms of embellishment on dress and accessories, of which this hat is a great example. The diverse decorations include a decorative straw plait hood which is overlaid with lace, then trimmed with large pleats of velvet, adorned with silk poppies and finished with a brocaded ribbon."@en , "Straw bonnet with brown velvet, lace and orange silk poppies."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/39d60d37-31a4-31c3-9dd3-0dca38358563> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/c5cefd8b-aa9a-36bc-8f5b-e9db790af50a> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Straw bonnet with brown velvet, lace and orange silk poppies."@en , "This bonnet is a style known as a 'capote' bonnet. It was worn at a forward angle on the crown of the head with the wearer's hair piled up high underneath. The bonnet was held on by the ribbons which tied in a large bow beneath the chin.\n\nThis period in the later 19th century saw a craze for all  forms of embellishment on dress and accessories, of which this hat is a great example. The diverse decorations include a decorative straw plait hood which is overlaid with lace, then trimmed with large pleats of velvet, adorned with silk poppies and finished with a brocaded ribbon."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/23f2bf68-831f-3860-983f-d9d538409eb2/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/23f2bf68-831f-3860-983f-d9d538409eb2/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/23f2bf68-831f-3860-983f-d9d538409eb2/dimension/3> ;
